Scope: this branch replays 27 authentic ternary certificate columns, not the
nested address readout experiment. New r=21/2 and r=14 certificates are
produced from the SHA-pinned excluded-coupling launcher; r=12 uses immutable
existing artifacts. The other seat's separate 243-certificate extraction is
not modified or presumed to have finished. Every direct-ratio comparison
uses Python integer numerator/denominator pairs only. A new independent
pair-fixed null at 27 can fail for lack of any feasible cube trades; that
is an explicit unresolved result, not evidence of no higher-order signal.
